  ! This list item is empty.
  
    2 │ fruits:
    3 │   - apple
  > 4 │   -
      │   ^
    5 │   - banana
    6 │ matrix:
  
  i An item with no value is read as null, and is often left by mistake.
  
  i Add a value to the item, or remove the item. If the item is meant to have no value, write null instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```

